    "detailed_description": "<h1>Interview by Minimap</h1><p>Check out this amazing interview prior to the Steam Next Fest by Minimap.<br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Choose to pilot a P-Type Jet Fighter, join Harrier Squadron, or play as an Immersive Gamer in the cockpit of the P-Type Fighter as you strive for a high score and take battle to the skies as you face off against these Alien Invaders as you serve the <strong>&quot;Polybius Space Force&quot;</strong><br><br>This super-scaled shoot 'em up explodes onto the scene with pinball-inspired scoring mechanics that'll have you racking up points and racking up thrills. Forget your dusty old flippers, you have guns, Polybius Invaders 2 throws you headfirst into a neon-drenched battle for Earth against the invading Arcadians.<br><br>Rack up points like a pro with chain reactions, multipliers, and hidden combos. Every enemy blast, every asteroid shattered, every pixel pulverized feeds your score meter, unlocking epic upgrades, missions and devastating power-ups.<br><br>Polybius Invaders 2 is more than just a shoot 'em up, it's a high-score chasing, pixel-perfect party! So grab your joystick, crank up Teknoaxe's synthwave soundtrack, and prepare to nuke the Arcadian menace in Polybius Invaders 2!<br><br>Download the demo of the Nuke Town table, but Remember, The full game explodes with even more missions, enemies, and pixelated mayhem!<br><br>Blast off into the stratosphere and ignite your Nitro Boost as you embark on exhilarating missions of relentless retro super-scaling arcade action.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618990/extras/63451804237f0f3ebe4152bd1496fa2c.avif?t=1707424734\" width=600 height=254 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Choose to pilot a P-Type Jet Fighter, join Harrier Squadron, or play as an Immersive Gamer in the cockpit of the P-Type Fighter as you strive for a high score and take battle to the skies as you face off against these Alien Invaders as you serve the <strong>&quot;Polybius Space Force&quot;</strong><br><br>This super-scaled shoot 'em up explodes onto the scene with pinball-inspired scoring mechanics that'll have you racking up points and racking up thrills. Forget your dusty old flippers, you have guns, Polybius Invaders 2 throws you headfirst into a neon-drenched battle for Earth against the invading Arcadians.<br><br>Rack up points like a pro with chain reactions, multipliers, and hidden combos. Every enemy blast, every asteroid shattered, every pixel pulverized feeds your score meter, unlocking epic upgrades, missions and devastating power-ups.<br><br>Polybius Invaders 2 is more than just a shoot 'em up, it's a high-score chasing, pixel-perfect party! So grab your joystick, crank up Teknoaxe's synthwave soundtrack, and prepare to nuke the Arcadian menace in Polybius Invaders 2!<br><br>Download the demo of the Nuke Town table, but Remember, The full game explodes with even more missions, enemies, and pixelated mayhem!<br><br>Blast off into the stratosphere and ignite your Nitro Boost as you embark on exhilarating missions of relentless retro super-scaling arcade action.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2618990/extras/63451804237f0f3ebe4152bd1496fa2c.avif?t=1707424734\" width=600 height=254 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Earth's fate hangs in the balance in this breathtaking retro inspired, Super Scaler Arcade Shoot-Em-Up.",
